d non-emergency communications for private and public entities.</a></div></li><li class="u-text-primary"><a href="/national-emergency-warning-system" class="nav-link cc-dropdown-link cc-no-left-pad w-dropdown-link"><strong>Genasys National Emergency Warning System</strong></a><div class="mega-menu-txt"><a href="/national-emergency-warning-system" class="link-3">No opt-in required for public safety warnings, notifications, and information to everyone in, or entering into, a crisis-affected area.</a></div></li><li class="u-text-primary"><a href="/resources" class="nav-link cc-dropdown-link cc-no-left-pad w-dropdown-link"><strong>Resources</strong></a><div class="mega-menu-txt"><a href="/resources" class="link-3">See brochures, case studies, webinars, and more.</a></div></li></ul></div><div class="col col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 mega-col_right"><a href="https://genasys.com/ebooks-whitepapers/genasys-protect-all-hazard-approach/" class="mega-guide-card w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69f39e369b14675d13fd1b1c/6a70aca5c2402a589599698a_Feature-Image-3.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69f39e369b14675d13fd1b1c/6a70aca5c2402a589599698a_Feature-Image-3-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69f39e369b14675d13fd1b1c/6a70aca5c2402a589599698a_Feature-Image-3-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69f39e369b14675d13fd1b1c/6a70aca5c2402a589599698a_Feature-Image-3.webp 950w" alt="" class="mega-guide-card_img"/><div class="mega-guide-card_overlay"><div class="featured-eyebrow u-text-green"><strong>Featured Resource</strong></div><div class="featured-header u-text-white"><strong>View Genasys Protect: All Hazard Approach eBook</strong></div></div><div class="mega-guide-card_arrow"><div class="code-embed-2 w-embed"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6